# Validation 4: the Magician is on, and wishes switch to it. 03's one button already ran the Magician check and turned
# the Magician on. The watch now says so on its Magician button ("✪ Magician: on (Opus 5.5)"), which opens the setup
# page. The wish box's Magic choice switches who answers typed wishes: the Magician ("infinite opportunities") or the
# Apprentice ("faster, but more limited"). It starts on the Magician once the Magician is on, so it is pressed twice:
# to the Apprentice, then back to the Magician, so the switch to it is seen.
@intent With the Magician on, the watch shows it, and the wish box switches wishes between the Apprentice and the Magician

@step the watch shows the Magician is on
@key key.use
@expect screen /make a wish/ within 10s
@wait 1s
@shot watch-magician-on
@click button "Magician: on (Opus 5.5)"
@expect screen Magician setup within 10s
@wait 1s
@shot magician-setup-on
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 1s

@step switch the wish box to the Apprentice
@key key.use
@expect screen /make a wish/ within 10s
@click button "Magician: infinite opportunities"
@wait 1s
@shot wishes-to-apprentice

@step and back to the Magician
@click button "Apprentice: faster, but more limited"
@wait 1s
@shot wishes-to-magician
@click button "Cancel"
